Tilesetter - Automatic tilemap/pixel map maker

Links:
-Itch.io: https://led.itch.io/tilesetter

Pros:
-Cheap ($12.99 currently)
-Has a free, simpler version
-Instant tileset generator & editor
-Smart map making
-Paid version allows direct exports to 4 different engines
-Works on Windows, Mac, and Linux
-Still receiving updates

Cons:
-May require more labor to import into many other game engines (Such as RPGMaker which this tool may be very useful for)
-Still in development so there’s a chance of glitches
